  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Optimizing Integrated Community Based Case Management of Newborn and Childhood Illness in Benishangul-Gumuz and Afar Regions of Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health personnel IMNCI, BEmONC, NBC, iCCM capacity building training and monitoring, providing improved services in public health centers and public health centers, support for neonatal and postpartum care-oriented evacuation systems, medical equipment and medicine targeting health facilities, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to contribute to improved health and reduce mortality among newborns and children1. &#xbaa8;&#xc131;, &#xc2e0;&#xc0dd;&#xc544;, &#xc544;&#xb3d9; &#xbcf4;&#xac74;&#xc758;&#xb8cc;(MNCH) &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xc9c8; &#xac1c;&#xc120;
